PC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":2264454314,"text":"はあ、なんで俺がこんなことやんなきゃいけないんだ？もっと経験豊富な先輩たちに任せておけばいいだろうに！","nextNodeIds":[736930102]},{"nodeId":736930102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":74204746,"text":"あれ？ここもイベントをやってる？","nextNodeIds":[736930103]},{"nodeId":736930103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":2315822858,"text":"おぉ、旅人か！えーと…そうだな。イベントは…その…ああ、やってるよ。","nextNodeIds":[736930104]},{"nodeId":736930104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":1895244882,"text":"まあ、イベントというよりか…探索待ちの秘境、って感じだけどな。","nextNodeIds":[736930105]},{"nodeId":736930105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3906439282,"text":"その秘境と学院フェスは関係ないの？","nextNodeIds":[736930106]},{"nodeId":736930106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":337368770,"text":"はぁ、その教令院主催の学院フェスとやらのために、俺はこんなことを任されちまったわけだ…","nextNodeIds":[736930107]},{"nodeId":736930107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":1224789826,"text":"っと、自己紹介が遅くなったな。俺はスパンタマッド学院所属のバハドルだ。俺たちの学院では、錬金術とか元素とか、そういうのを研究してる…","nextNodeIds":[736930108]},{"nodeId":736930108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":2823446954,"text":"とにかく、今回はこんなことを任されちまったわけだが…スパンタマッド学院として出せるミニゲームなんて、どう考えてもピンとこなくてさ。","nextNodeIds":[736930109]},{"nodeId":736930109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":387227826,"text":"例えば錬金台を置いて、錬金術の体験をさせるとか？そんなのどう考えてもつまらないだろ…","nextNodeIds":[736930110]},{"nodeId":736930110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":3798092210,"text":"かといって…元素反応を展示するとかも無理だしな。万が一事故でも起こって、会場が大爆発したら一大事だ…","nextNodeIds":[736930111]},{"nodeId":736930111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":3891786882,"text":"仕方ないから、冒険者協会に相談したんだ。そして彼らの協力のもと、秘境を見つけたのさ。","nextNodeIds":[736930112]},{"nodeId":736930112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":3139284538,"text":"仲間たちと秘境の下見をしてみたが、内部は正直、かなり入り組んでる。","nextNodeIds":[736930113]},{"nodeId":736930113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":2378555978,"text":"だから秘境の特殊な状況に対応できるよう、仲間たちと一緒に錬金薬剤を何種類か開発したんだ。","nextNodeIds":[736930114]},{"nodeId":736930114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":595470922,"text":"これでひとまず、我が学院らしいところは体現できたわけだ。ハハハ…","nextNodeIds":[736930115]},{"nodeId":736930115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":174122882,"text":"旅人、もし興味があるなら、この薬剤を持って秘境に行ってみるといい。秘境の場所は後で<color=#00E1FFFF>マップ</color>に記してやるからな。","nextNodeIds":[736930116,736930117]},{"nodeId":736930116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":927997650,"text":"誰か…遊びに来る人はいる？","nextNodeIds":[736930118]},{"nodeId":736930117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3338858730,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}の他に、遊びに来る人はいるかな…","nextNodeIds":[736930118]},{"nodeId":736930118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":2201955442,"text":"ほ、他にもだな、秘境に興味があって挑む冒険者たちが結構いるんだよ。","nextNodeIds":[736930119]},{"nodeId":736930119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":1862093802,"text":"確かに、学院の学生はあまり来ないが…","nextNodeIds":[736930120]},{"nodeId":736930120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":1610186786,"text":"ま、とにかくだ、興味があれば秘境に行ってみるといい。","nextNodeIds":[736930121]},{"nodeId":736930121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":1925130210,"text":"冒険者たちの話だと、あの秘境はかなり「チャレンジング」だとさ。","nextNodeIds":[736930122,736930124]},{"nodeId":736930126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":1103880602,"text":"そうだ、もし秘境に行くならこの特別な薬剤をやるよ…とにかく、探索する時は安全に十分気をつけるんだぜ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7369301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30348"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1503014866,"text":"じゃ、秘境に行ってみる。"},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":2705479162,"text":"本当に行くのか？分かった、この薬剤を渡しておこう…"},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1681884018,"text":"他に用事がある。"},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","textMapHash":1039923706,"text":"そうか？分かった、俺はここで留守番だ…"}],"talkIds":[7369301],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30348,"speakerName":"バハドル","count":20},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":6}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[173693],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":3320268438,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Sumeru_73693/Q7369301","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EF